{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：09:50 2026-09-02 HKT</p>\n\n<p>青衣長康邨康豐樓對開，今（2日）早上8時59分，一名男子由高處墮下，倒地不起。救援人員接報到場，經檢驗後證實他當場不治。</p>\n<p>現場遺下一對鞋，警方圍封涉事範圍並登樓調查，證實死者是52歲姓梁男子，相信他從大廈天台墮下。人員沒有檢獲遺書，事主墮樓原因仍有待調查。</p>\n<img alt=\"墮樓男子當場不治。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/be68814b30d8f02f1786a6afacb77aac/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-02_at_09_38_36_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"消防接報到場。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e0e09392e8cdceaaf3374596a01a28f8/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-02_at_09_38_36_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/11f31e9206e8e3ec22baebc8bd032703/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-02_at_09_38_36.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/41da8423d4c0b0189d9da3562e74639c/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-02_at_09_38_35.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b3d0deffdc680c8e238c17cfcc2e477b/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-02_at_09_38_37.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-02T06:01:53.515515+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":154,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}